[{:db/id 17592186203922 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-d5414df0-8556-5960-86b0-386e378b451e"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186416862 :question/problem "Consider the following relation defined on the set $A={1,3,5,7}.$ \n\n$$\nR={(1,3),(1,5),(3,5),(5,7)}\n$$\n\nSelect the options that make the following reasoning correct:\n\nWe have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(1,1){{field-1}}R,\\,(3,3){{field-2}}R,\\,(5,5){{field-3}}R,\\,(7,7){{field-4}}R\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since \n{{field-5}}{{field-6}}, \n\nthe relation is \n{{field-7}}." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186416859 :question/problem "Consider the following relation defined on the set $A={5,8,10}.$ \n\n$$\nR={(5,5),(5,8),(8,10),(10,5),(10,8)}\n$$\n\nSelect the options that make the following reasoning correct:\n\nSince \n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}, \n\nthe relation is \n{{field-3}}." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186416854 :question/problem "Consider the following relation defined on the set $A={0,1,2}.$ \n\n$$\nR={(0,0),(0,1),(1,1),(2,0),(2,1)}\n$$\n\nSelect the options that make the following reasoning correct:\n\nSince \n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}, \n\nthe relation is \n{{field-3}}." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186416852 :question/problem "Consider the following relation defined on the set $A={△,♢,♡}.$\n\n$$\nR={(△,♡),(△,♢),(♢,♡)}\n$$\n\nSelect the options that make the following reasoning correct:\n\nWe have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(△,△){{field-1}}R,\\,(♢,♢){{field-2}}R,\\,(♡,♡){{field-3}}R\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since\n{{field-4}}{{field-5}},\n\nthe relation is\n{{field-6}}." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-d5414df0-8556-5960-86b0-386e378b451e" :question/id #uuid "d5414df0-8556-5960-86b0-386e378b451e" :question/math-academy-id "q-213229" :question/problem "![](images/9c/9cddd6584fee52757b1c7a470a6eeffee3678d569e36025ca70c99e5543c71c2.png)\n\nWhich of the plots above represent a relation, defined on the set $A={\\alpha ,\\beta ,\\delta },$ that is neither reflexive nor irreflexive?" :question/worked-solution "A binary relation $R,$ defined on a set $A,$ is \n\n- *reflexive* if $(x,x)\\in R$ for all $x\\in A,$\n\n- *irreflexive* if $(x,x)\\notin R$ for all $x\\in A.$\n\nIf some pairs of the form $(x,x)$ belong to a relation and others do not, then the relation is neither reflexive nor irreflexive.\n\nSince $R$ must be neither reflective nor irreflexive, some of the points $(\\alpha ,\\alpha ),$ $(\\beta ,\\beta ),$ and $(\\delta ,\\delta )$ must be in $R,$ and others must not.\n\nThese ordered pairs correspond to the diagonal points on the plots, as shown below:\n\n![](images/7d/7d4257c9e249f9a4c2a53c5566292e21ae6dfa7f0e08e27042548da2d8e7e000.png)\n\n \n\nA plot corresponding to a relation that is neither reflexive nor irreflexive must contain some diagonal points, but not all of them. Therefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ed0ab4b8-5966-5883-ba7e-805d59df8d8f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ed0ab4b8-5966-5883-ba7e-805d59df8d8f" :answer-field/id #uuid "ed0ab4b8-5966-5883-ba7e-805d59df8d8f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-4d14ebfe-075c-5ad1-ac77-3e3c8fa226f9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4d14ebfe-075c-5ad1-ac77-3e3c8fa226f9" "answer-b23e5cb8-be50-53e9-bf24-a7374c9dcd80" "answer-f2516513-8240-538a-acb7-6adbea086ea6" "answer-25029d74-6c31-52ad-8e40-faedc9e473db" "answer-618e807a-28cb-599f-9e9f-ea6004064c9e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4d14ebfe-075c-5ad1-ac77-3e3c8fa226f9" :answer/id #uuid "4d14ebfe-075c-5ad1-ac77-3e3c8fa226f9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b23e5cb8-be50-53e9-bf24-a7374c9dcd80" :answer/id #uuid "b23e5cb8-be50-53e9-bf24-a7374c9dcd80" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f2516513-8240-538a-acb7-6adbea086ea6" :answer/id #uuid "f2516513-8240-538a-acb7-6adbea086ea6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-25029d74-6c31-52ad-8e40-faedc9e473db" :answer/id #uuid "25029d74-6c31-52ad-8e40-faedc9e473db" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-618e807a-28cb-599f-9e9f-ea6004064c9e" :answer/id #uuid "618e807a-28cb-599f-9e9f-ea6004064c9e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186416861 :question/problem "Let $R$ be a relation defined on the set $Z$ as follows: \n\n$\\,$ $x\\,R\\,y$ if and only if $2∤(y-x)$ \n\nSelect the options that make the following reasoning correct:\n\nSince \n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}, \n\nthe relation is \n{{field-3}}." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186204236 :question/problem "Let $R$ be a relation defined on the set $Z$ as follows: \n\n$\\,$ $x\\,R\\,y$ if and only if $x-{y}^{2}=0$ \n\nSelect the options that make the following reasoning correct:\n\nSince \n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}, \n\nthe relation is \n{{field-3}}." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186416860 :question/problem "Let $R$ be a relation defined on the set $R$ as follows: \n\n$\\,$ $x\\,R\\,y$ if and only if $y-{x}^{3}\\ne 0$ \n\nSelect the options that make the following reasoning correct:\n\nSince \n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}, \n\nthe relation is \n{{field-3}}." :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
